        {
          "_name": "news06",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".item-wrapper": {
              "overflow": "hidden",
              "background": "@rowColor",
              "margin-bottom": "2rem",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "1rem"
              }
            },
            ".text-wrapper": {
              "padding": "4rem 3rem 4rem 1rem",
              "@media (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 991px)": {
                "padding": "2.25rem"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "padding": "1.5rem"
              }
            },
            "& when (@reverseContent)": {
              ".row": {
                "flex-direction": "row-reverse"
              },
              ".text-wrapper": {
                "padding": "4rem 2rem 4rem 3rem",
                "@media (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 991px)": {
                  "padding": "2.25rem"
                },
                "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                  "padding": "1.5rem"
                }
              }
            },
            ".row": {
              "align-items": "center",
              "margin-right": "-1rem",
              "margin-left": "-1rem"
            },
            ".image-wrapper": {
              "padding": "0 1rem"
            },
            "img, .image-wrapper": {
              "height": "(@imageHeight * 100px)",
              "object-fit": "cover",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "max-height": "350px"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#ffffff",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "text-align": "left",
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".price": {
              "color": "#ffffff",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            ".content-head": {
              "max-width": "800px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-maintitle": {
              "text-align": "center",
              "color": "#ff0302"
            },
            ".mbr-section-mainsubtitle": {
              "text-align": "center"
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"news06\" group=\"News\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen, 'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n    <header>Image</header>\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Height\" name=\"imageHeight\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Main Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Main Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Price\" name=\"showPrice\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n    <header>Color</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"rowColor\" value=\"#000000\" selected>\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1-1.jpg\">\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#000000\" selected>\n      <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n    </fieldset>\n    <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1-1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 mb-5 content-head\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n        <h3 class=\"mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mbr-section-maintitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-maintitle\"><b>Estudo de Aplicativo</b></h3>\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4 mbr-section-mainsubtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-mainsubtitle\">\n          Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Praesent vitae erat. Integer aliquam, lorem\n          vitae dapibus sollicitudin, nibh nisl egestas enim, ut dapibus odio augue tempus venenatis mi\n          semper.\n        </h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center align-items-center item features-image\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 \">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper\">\n              <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/2-508x339.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg col-md-12\">\n              <div class=\"text-wrapper align-left\">\n                <h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>Estudo de Aplicativo</b></h5>\n                <p class=\"price mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showPrice\" data-app-selector=\".price\"><b>ESTUDO DE CASO: </b>Plataforma de agenda para eventos<b><br></b></p>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"><b>ESCOPO</b><br>Plataforma de gestão de eventos projetada para encontros corporativos de grande porte, como palestras, workshops e atividades de networking para até 2 mil participantes.\n<br>\n<br><b>PARTICIPANTES</b><br>Acessam o app pelo seu e-mail de entrada (identificação), montam sua própria agenda escolhendo as atividades de interesse, recebem notificações e orientações em tempo real e têm controle de presença no evento — tudo em uma interface móvel, elegante e offline-tolerante.\n<br>\n<br><b>EQUIPE DA ORGANIZAÇÃO</b><br>Administra todo o ciclo do evento pelo painel de gestão: cadastro de eventos e atividades, importação e exportação de participantes, envio de notificações programadas e relatórios completos de presença e engajamento, com acesso segmentado por perfil (administrador, gestor, equipe de eventos e patrocinador).\n<br>\n<br>Com identidade visual sofisticada, a aplicação une praticidade para o participante e controles para o organizador.<br><br>Foram desenvolvidos 03 protótipos funcionais, em 03 ambientes/plataformas distintas para avaliação e definição da melhor opção.<br><br>Opção A: Via plataforma de LowCode<br><br>Opções B e C: Via plataformas de NoCode<br><br></p>\n                <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-lg btn-primary\" href=\"mailto:marketing@ojohn.com.br?subject=App%20Eventos\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Saiba+</a></div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n  </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "news06-h",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "vwak4lu5xe",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "_name": "pricing02",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = \"color\")": {
